{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "宿", "id": "宿"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "畔", "id": "畔"}, {"form": "美", "id": "美"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.3997014033914143, "source": "昔", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.3012613305781618, "source": "昔", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.569772656041669, "source": "昔", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 2.0397762852874046, "source": "公", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.9560670171615597, "source": "公", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.5889434030299426, "source": "公", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.569772656041669, "source": "公", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 2.2910907135683107, "source": "言", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.8019163373343012, "source": "言", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.108769156774356, "source": "言", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 3.207381445442466, "source": "言", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.5142342648825204, "source": "言", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.108769156774356, "source": "言", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.5142342648825204, "source": "言", "target": "吿"}, {"weight": 1.821087084322575, "source": "言", "target": "宿"}, {"weight": 1.0928485839513595, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.7669972333778885, "source": "行", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.6683849447097785, "source": "行", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.3012613305781618, "source": "畔"